{
  "schema": "raven-replay-adapter-registry/1",
  "note": "Local explicit registry. Cases may name an id listed here; they cannot install packages or supply entrypoints. Operator setup installs pinned dependencies once. dependency_packages lists declared roots; runner expands the full transitive closure + local adapter-directory helpers into dependency_binding_sha256.",
